}}'''Starfish (Knife)''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from [[2024 Summer Box]] during the [[Summer Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event as since ended.

== Appearance ==
It shares the same mesh and texture to the default knife, but it spots 5 starfishes: One in the bottom part of the handle and the remaining four on the inner blade.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Starfish (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
